{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"MIC","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"彌迦書","commonName":"彌迦書","title":"彌迦書","order":33,"numberOfChapters":7,"sha256":"7653aa64f11ed5e86b64f5806ce4393d656010dca6eac643843bbaa97a4000ce","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/MIC/1.json","lastChapterNumber":7,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/MIC/7.json","totalNumberOfVerses":105},"chapter":{"number":2,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["欺壓者的命運"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"躺在床上圖謀不軌、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"盤算作惡的人有禍了！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"天一亮，他們就依仗手中的權勢行惡。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們貪圖田地，就去霸佔；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"想要房屋，就去搶奪。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們欺壓人的全家，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"詐取別人的產業。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以，耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「我正計劃降災懲罰你們這族，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們無法逃脫，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"再也不能趾高氣揚，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為這是你們災禍臨頭的日子。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"到那日，人們要唱悲戚的哀歌譏諷你們說，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"『我們徹底完了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華把我們的產業轉給別人。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂竟拿走我們的產業，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"把田地分給擄掠我們的人。』」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，他們在耶和華的會眾中將無人抽籤分地。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"他們的先知說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「不要說預言了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要預言這種事，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們不會蒙受羞辱。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雅各家啊，你們怎能說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「耶和華已經不耐煩了嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂會做這些事嗎？」","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華說：「我的話豈不有益於行為正直的人嗎？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"近來，你們像仇敵一樣起來攻擊我的子民","poem":1},{"noteId":1},{"text":"。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們剝去那些如從戰場歸來一樣毫無戒備的過路人的外衣。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們把我子民中的婦女從她們的幸福家園趕走，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又從她們的子女身上永遠地奪去我的尊榮。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們起來走吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這裡不再是你們的安居之地！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為這裡已遭玷污，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被徹底毀壞。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"倘若有騙子撒謊說，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"『我預言你們會有美酒佳釀。』","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他就會成為這個民族的先知。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"text":"「雅各家啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必把你們都聚集起來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必把以色列的餘民集合起來。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要將他們安頓在一起，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好像羊圈裡的羊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又如草場上的羊群；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那裡必人聲鼎沸。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"開路者要走在他們前面，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"帶領他們衝出敵人的城門。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的王走在前面，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華親自引導他們。」","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":1,"caller":"+","text":"「你們像仇敵一樣起來攻擊我的子民」或譯「我的子民如仇敵一樣興起來」。","reference":{"chapter":2,"verse":8}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/MIC/2.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/MIC/3.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/MIC/1.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":13}